Walang kinalaman si Eun-su dito.

44
00:05:06.723 --> 00:05:07.807
Tatlong bilyon.

45
00:05:10.727 --> 00:05:13.104
Wala akong pera.

46
00:05:15.189 --> 00:05:16.274
talaga?

47
00:05:16.774 --> 00:05:18.900
Kaya dapat ko na lang kausapin si Jin-young

48
